Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.80,0:00:16.80,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}The rules keep changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.64,0:00:25.64,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}I've been rehearsing every possible outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.80,0:00:36.08,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}Once this thought arises, there is no more room for right or wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.24,0:00:44.72,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}I am resolved to sever this flood
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.84,0:00:51.08,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}so that my soul can break free from mediocrity,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.32,0:00:55.44,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}from loneliness and distinction.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.92,0:01:00.40,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)}One more step and you'll fall into madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.60,0:01:05.40,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}Don't fall down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:08.60,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,150)}I look towards the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.68,0:01:11.24,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)}Chase !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.44,0:01:14.44,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Refined to perfection.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.00,0:01:20.36,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Never retreat, no matter the danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.48,0:01:23.40,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I dare to defy the heavens !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.88,0:01:27.24,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Always overcome the obstacles,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.43,0:01:29.60,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}ignite the seas with blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.76,0:01:34.04,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}bloom through trials and tribulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.20,0:01:38.68,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Even the sharpest thorns
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.80,0:01:43.24,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,1000)}will be reduced into ashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.28,0:01:47.56,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}What is there to fear ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:56.72,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.20,0:02:18.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Ancient Thunder Dragon was born from lightning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.00,0:02:20.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,The legends say that back then,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.12,0:02:23.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,it wielded the Divine Retributions on behalf of the law of the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.72,0:02:26.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I rely on my own strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.60,0:02:27.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll never escape it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.44,0:02:33.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,But if I borrow the power of the Abyss,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.04,0:02:35.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,I still have a glimmer of hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.80,0:02:52.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now or never !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.08,0:02:53.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stop !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.40,0:03:04.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,The cave I saw before
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.64,0:03:05.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,should be nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.08,0:03:08.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I can enter it,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.08,0:03:10.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can use it to resist the suction force.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.44,0:03:14.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Found it !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.48,0:03:29.76,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(224,461)}Cave at the bottom\Nof the Tide Abyss
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.60,0:03:29.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,I did it !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.04,0:03:39.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,How could there be
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.72,0:03:40.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,a teleportation formation here !?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.08,0:03:44.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,With the Stop spell, I could slay this beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.48,0:03:47.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,But since it is at death's door
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.76,0:03:49.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,this is the perfect chance to devour it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.56,0:03:52.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fortune favors the brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.88,0:03:54.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Seeking the Dao is risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.68,0:04:05.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Soul Devourer !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.28,0:04:09.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Absorb !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.52,0:04:46.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)\pos(972,524)}1 year later
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.24,0:05:10.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,I only refined 20% of the Ancient Thunder Dragon
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.56,0:05:14.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,but my Origin Soul has already transformed into a Thunder Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.40,0:05:17.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Trying to destroy my Origin Soul now
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.20,0:05:20.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,would be the same as trying to destroy Divine Retribution lightning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.24,0:05:23.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,My spells also contain the might of this heavenly lightning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.48,0:05:25.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,With this lightning power,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.20,0:05:28.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,I could even fight a Late stage Ascendant cultivator.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.16,0:05:32.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,My Origin Soul can't leave my body anymore !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.52,0:05:35.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,I suppose this barrier
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.44,0:05:38.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,must be the price for transforming my Origin Soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.92,0:05:41.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wonder how Senior Zhou Yi is doing
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.36,0:05:43.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,and where the Mosquito Beast is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.12,0:05:46.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,My teleportation failed,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.52,0:05:47.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Earth Escape is blocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.60,0:05:50.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can't even use the token to enter the Celestial Cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.96,0:05:53.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,This place
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.28,0:05:56.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,is actually a dead end.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.96,0:06:12.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.68,0:06:13.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,What is that lightning
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.24,0:06:15.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,in your eyes !?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.56,0:06:19.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Back then, you said you knew the Tide Abyss very well
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.84,0:06:21.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,and knew how to escape from this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.08,0:06:24.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,This place...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.24,0:06:25.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Where are we ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.56,0:06:29.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,The...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.96,0:06:31.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,The bottom of the Abyss !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.56,0:06:37.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,I only ever scouted on the periphery.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.96,0:06:39.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,I never thought I'd come to the bottom !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.92,0:06:41.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to get out either !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.48,0:06:43.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.92,0:06:44.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wait !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.76,0:06:45.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't know the way out
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.92,0:06:47.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,but I know the All-Seer's secret !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.28,0:06:51.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,As long as you're willing to release me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.56,0:06:52.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will tell you !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.36,0:06:54.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.60,0:06:56.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.72,0:06:58.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,must swear on your Dao Heart !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.96,0:07:01.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,I saw Master devour Sun Yun !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.76,0:07:05.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,For a long time,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.88,0:07:08.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,disciples of the Heavenly Fate Sect rarely reached the 2nd step.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.40,0:07:09.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,There are many speculations about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.16,0:07:11.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Among them
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.04,0:07:12.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,the most widespread theory is
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.24,0:07:15.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,that the All-Seer refines his own domain
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.64,0:07:17.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,by devouring his 2nd step disciples.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.96,0:07:19.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,I didn't believe it at the time
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.60,0:07:20.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,until that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.56,0:07:24.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,The technique I cultivate can absorb spiritual energy from beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.96,0:07:25.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,That day,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.76,0:07:27.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,while I was devouring a mountain spirit beast,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.76,0:07:29.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,I unintentionally saw its memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.40,0:07:32.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,That mountain spirit beast had witnessed
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.60,0:07:34.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,the battle between Master and Sun Yun
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.32,0:07:35.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,with its own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.36,0:07:38.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Back then, the two were dueling in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.72,0:07:41.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Initially, Sun Yun could fight Master to a draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.92,0:07:42.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,But at the critical moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.04,0:07:45.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,a strange mark lit up on Sun Yun's forehead
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.84,0:07:47.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,which caused him to lose instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.52,0:07:49.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the next second,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.16,0:07:52.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,he was devoured alive by Master !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.44,0:07:54.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,In that moment, I understood
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.48,0:07:56.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,that those terrible rumors
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.56,0:07:58.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,were all true.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.44,0:08:00.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,A strange mark ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.08,0:08:03.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Was it this one ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.40,0:08:06.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Exactly !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.84,0:08:07.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,At that time,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.56,0:08:09.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,was Master wearing a gray robe ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.60,0:08:11.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,It was gray !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.84,0:08:13.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I did find it a bit strange,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.64,0:08:15.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,I had never seen Master wear a gray robe before !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.28,0:08:17.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Back in the Ancient Demon Inheritance,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.52,0:08:20.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,I already sensed this slaughter energy was problematic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.60,0:08:24.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sun Yun must have seen through the All-Seer's scheme before that
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.24,0:08:27.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,which is why he didn't cultivate it to completion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.00,0:08:30.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,But he still couldn't escape being devoured...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.44,0:08:32.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,It looks like
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.08,0:08:35.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,the spells the All-Seer passes on to his disciples
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.60,0:08:37.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,are also the shackles he places on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.20,0:08:39.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can't stay on Planet Tian Yun
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.96,0:08:40.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.28,0:08:46.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,This person is ruthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.48,0:08:49.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can't just wait for death here !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.92,0:08:51.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, my cultivation is too low.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.56,0:08:52.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.24,0:08:54.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,maybe I can reach Ascendant !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.76,0:08:58.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although my Origin Soul is sealed right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.04,0:09:00.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,by borrowing Ascendant origin energy
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.12,0:09:02.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,I might be able to breakthrough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.40,0:09:04.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Reaching Ascendant
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.60,0:09:05.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,isn't entirely hopeless !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.08,0:09:12.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Did he just read my thoughts ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.80,0:09:16.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestial Emperor Qing Lin's jade slip recorded the Shadow Escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.68,0:09:19.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,But it can only be used by a Celestial Guard...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.12,0:09:21.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,It might be my chance to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.36,0:09:24.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although the success rate of refining one is slim,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.84,0:09:26.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have no choice but to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.72,0:09:28.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,You have one chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.08,0:09:31.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you can reach Ascendant,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.04,0:09:33.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will grant you a great fortune
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.36,0:09:36.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,to help you reach Illusory Yin and Corporeal Yang.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.36,0:09:38.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,But the condition is
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.36,0:09:41.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,that you will let me refine you into a Celestial Guard
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.40,0:09:44.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,and serve me for 1000 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.88,0:09:45.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,A Celestial Guard ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.52,0:09:48.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Will I retain my consciousness ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.48,0:09:50.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you're still alive in 1000 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.60,0:09:52.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will give you back your freedom and your consciousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.28,0:09:57.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will gamble !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.68,0:09:59.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will gamble on me living 1000 years !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.92,0:10:00.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Alright,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.04,0:10:01.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am willing !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.56,0:11:06.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now that he's Ascendant,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.32,0:11:09.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,he's ready to become a Celestial Guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.76,0:11:10.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Next,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.36,0:11:12.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must refine his physical body.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.88,0:11:25.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.76,0:11:28.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,he only achieved copper-rank strength...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.36,0:11:31.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since his body is too weak,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.76,0:11:34.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll have to borrow the Heavenly Ghosts' strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.15,0:11:40.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Note: Wang Lin obtained the Heavenly Ghost from Luo Yun of the Heavenly Ghost Sect when he arrived in the Demon Spirit Land.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.24,0:11:42.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Refine !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.08,0:12:04.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,1000)\pos(153,472)}6 months later
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.76,0:12:12.88,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(218,464)\fad(300,300)}Celestial Guard Du Jian\NIllusory Yin
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.68,0:12:12.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,An Illusory Yin puppet !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.36,0:12:15.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestial Emperor Qing Lin truly had impressive means.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.76,0:12:17.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Conceal !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.16,0:12:21.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,With the Celestial Guard's Shadow Escape,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.64,0:12:23.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have a 60% chance to leave this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.20,0:12:26.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,When the token was taking shape,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.16,0:12:28.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,I failed to get the last sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.48,0:12:31.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,If my guess is correct,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.16,0:12:33.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,the token condensed from the purple mist
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.40,0:12:36.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,is the token that fell in the tide back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.44,0:12:40.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,This token is the key to opening the true Celestial Cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.44,0:12:43.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,The All-Seer and the others have coveted it for too long
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.72,0:12:45.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,so I must hide it carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.28,0:12:48.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,I obtained 7 of the 12 Swords' swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.00,0:12:51.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,With them, I can use the Seven Star Sword Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.84,0:12:53.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I also channel it with Divine Retribution Lightning,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.76,0:12:56.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will become even stronger !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.04,0:13:02.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just these artifacts
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.60,0:13:03.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,are not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.72,0:13:05.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.44,0:13:08.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wealth...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.40,0:13:10.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let me have a look
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.56,0:13:12.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,at the secrets you are hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.44,0:13:21.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Heavenly Chop !?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.48,0:13:23.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you know
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.04,0:13:25.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,the meaning of 'Chopping the net' ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.20,0:13:27.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.04,0:13:31.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Observe the sentient beings
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.36,0:13:33.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,to obtain the essence of this technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.20,0:13:46.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,The sentient beings...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.04,0:13:48.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,The words 'Chopping the net'...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.68,0:13:51.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's the connection between them ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.68,0:14:10.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(153,465)\fad(500,500)}3 years later
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.16,0:14:14.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Chopping the net...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.36,0:14:18.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,What does 'Chopping the net' mean ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.80,0:14:31.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,I get it !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.04,0:14:33.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,The heavens are a net.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.76,0:14:35.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,All sentient beings
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.00,0:14:37.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,are intertwined in a myriad of ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.96,0:14:40.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are all bound by the rules of the heavens and the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.40,0:14:42.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,From birth to death,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.88,0:14:44.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,we all live in a net.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.64,0:14:47.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the Heavenly Chop
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.56,0:14:50.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,severs this very net of heaven and earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.64,0:14:52.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,It severs
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.12,0:14:55.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,the rules that govern all sentient beings !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.88,0:15:04.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Once this sword is used,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.28,0:15:06.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,it can sever one's destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.24,0:15:09.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,and defy the rules !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.04,0:15:12.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.20,0:15:14.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Heavenly Chop !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.52,0:15:15.64,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,000)\pos(199,402)}Heavenly Chop
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.56,0:15:18.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sever !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.84,0:15:40.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,In just a few years,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.36,0:15:43.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,the suction force has increased a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.28,0:15:45.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could there be something else
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.56,0:15:46.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,at the bottom of the Abyss ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.72,0:15:50.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,I painstakingly comprehended the Heavenly Chop
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.96,0:15:52.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,thinking I could finally escape
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.80,0:15:55.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,only for it to be all in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.12,0:15:58.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fate...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.16,0:15:59.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Destiny...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.48,0:16:03.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everyone’s happiness is different…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.76,0:16:05.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,What I seek
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.20,0:16:08.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,is to accompany my parents,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.32,0:16:11.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,to accompany Wan'er...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.24,0:16:15.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yet the Dao I have chosen
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.16,0:16:19.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,is one of solitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.80,0:16:23.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since it has come to this,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.44,0:16:25.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,I won't overthink it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.04,0:16:29.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,I might as well use the time I have
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.96,0:16:32.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,to extract the slaughter energy from my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.00,0:16:51.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Life Seals are just a manifestation
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.44,0:16:55.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,of the slaughter energy deeply planted within me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.96,0:17:07.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's bearable
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.12,0:17:09.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,but not enough !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.36,0:17:14.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Suction force,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.28,0:17:16.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,come at me !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.08,0:17:21.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Show yourselves !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.96,0:17:25.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,1 083 222 strands of slaughter energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.00,0:17:29.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,the exact same number of Life Seals I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.68,0:17:34.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,The suction force isn't strong enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.44,0:17:55.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestial Guard,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.60,0:17:56.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Shadow Escape !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.08,0:18:36.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\pos(152,468)}6 months later
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.00,0:18:56.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,My million Life Seals
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.40,0:19:00.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,have finally been removed !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.56,0:19:16.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Greed !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.28,0:19:19.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,I ordered you to protect my disciples !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.32,0:19:21.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,How could they have died like this !?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.00,0:19:33.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,The compass has been giving frequent warnings lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.72,0:19:35.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Xi Xue...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.68,0:19:39.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,What exactly have you encountered ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.60,0:19:41.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivators,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.96,0:19:44.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wish to advance the opening of the Demon Spirit Land
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.00,0:19:46.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,by 10 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.68,0:19:49.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Does anyone have any objections ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.04,0:19:50.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.88,0:19:51.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,I agree !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.36,0:19:55.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.76,0:19:58.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,you dared to forcibly remove the Life Seals.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.36,0:20:00.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since that's the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.40,0:20:03.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can't let you live.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.12,0:22:39.96,Note,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,000)}Celestial Guards are split into the following ranks: gold, silver, copper, iron. Gold being the strongest and iron being the weakest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.00,0:20:32.48,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Ask
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.60,0:20:30.40,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1514,677)}Qi Condensation
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.52,0:20:32.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}the perilous path filled with countless blades.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.04,0:20:33.68,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1299,685)}Foundation Establishment
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.20,0:20:39.36,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Can the mundane world be shattered
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.56,0:20:37.00,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1557,705)\fad(800,000)}Core Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.76,0:20:40.44,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,000)\pos(1557,705)}Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.00,0:20:39.36,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}by a child's steadfast heart ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.48,0:20:45.60,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}If the laws of this world
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.32,0:20:43.88,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(368,638)\fad(800,300)}Soul Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.20,0:20:47.08,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1445,688)\fad(800,000)}Soul Transformation
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.28,0:20:45.60,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}stand in the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.56,0:20:52.40,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I'll defy the universe to tread the heavens
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.40,0:20:53.36,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1574,688)\fad(800,000)}Ascendant
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.76,0:20:52.40,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}and ask this question to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.84,0:20:58.28,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}My heart's deepest wish
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.22,0:20:58.28,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}is to not kneel before these mountains and rivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.44,0:21:05.36,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Don't accept your doomed fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.00,0:21:05.36,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}karma can be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.76,0:21:11.12,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Unwilling to let go,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.28,0:21:11.12,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}my obsessions propel me forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.12,0:21:18.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.44,0:21:18.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Thunder rumbles as I dare to tread through the reincarnation cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.60,0:21:23.04,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}Accept your fate and stay mortal or defy it to become immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.04,0:21:23.04,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}Hold fast to this resolve and break through the obstacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.16,0:21:26.88,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I'll fight all those who dare to stand in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.48,0:21:26.88,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Let the winds of war heed my command.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.96,0:21:32.60,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I sign this question with my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.56,0:21:32.60,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}What is the Dao ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.92,0:21:36.44,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Defying the flow of heaven and earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.28,0:21:36.44,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}the heart I cultivate stays true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.44,0:21:40.00,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I contemplate the wisdom of heaven and earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.48,0:21:40.00,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I shall choose my path between karma and fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.08,0:21:45.40,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}My unshakable Dao Heart
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.84,0:21:45.40,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}aspires to ascend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.76,0:21:51.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Defying,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.08,0:21:51.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}this is what my journey to treading the heavens relies on.
